    Fin.sum_univ_succ,Fin.rev,Nat.testBit,Nat.shiftRight_eq_div_pow,Fin.succ] at hn0 hn1 hf0 hf1 hf2 hf3 hf4 hf5 h01 h02 h03 h04 h05 h12 h13 h14 h15 h23 h24 h25 h34 h35 h45
